    "cli.cloud.domains.usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage:\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\nVerify a domain you own first: `verify` prints the DNS records to add, then run it\nagain to complete. `publish --domain` then accepts that domain or any one-label child.\nGenerated names use <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh and need no verification.\nAccess defaults to the owning team or personal owner. Email grants apply to one port only.\nPublic access requires confirmation; --yes confirms it for scripts. Add --json for JSON output."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用方法:\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\nカスタムドメインは先にverifyを実行し、表示されたDNSレコードを追加した後、もう一度verifyを実行して所有権確認を完了してください。\npublish --domainには確認済みドメイン、またはその直下1階層のサブドメインを指定できます。\n生成される名前は<vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.shで、DNS確認は不要です。\n既定のアクセス権は所有チームまたは個人所有者です。メールのアクセス許可は1つのポートにのみ適用されます。\n公開アクセスには確認が必要です。スクリプトでは--yesで確認できます。JSON出力には--jsonを追加してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法:\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\n请先验证你拥有的域名：`verify` 会打印需要添加的 DNS 记录，添加后再次运行\n即可完成验证。之后 `publish --domain` 可接受该域名或它的任意一级子域名。\n生成的名称形如 <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh，无需验证。\n访问级别默认归属所属团队或个人所有者。邮箱授权仅对单个端口生效。\n公开访问需要确认；脚本中可用 --yes 直接确认。加 --json 输出 JSON。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verwendung:\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\nVerifizieren Sie zuerst eine Domain, die Sie besitzen: `verify` gibt die hinzuzufügenden DNS-Einträge aus, führen Sie es dann\nerneut aus, um den Vorgang abzuschließen. `publish --domain` akzeptiert dann diese Domain oder jedes einteilige Subdomain-Label.\nGenerierte Namen verwenden <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh und erfordern keine Verifizierung.\nDer Zugriff ist standardmäßig auf das besitzende Team oder den persönlichen Eigentümer eingestellt. E-Mail-Freigaben gelten nur für einen Port.\nÖffentlicher Zugriff erfordert eine Bestätigung; --yes bestätigt dies für Skripte. Fügen Sie --json für die JSON-Ausgabe hinzu."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisation :\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\nVérifiez d'abord un domaine que vous possédez : `verify` affiche les enregistrements DNS à ajouter, puis exécutez-le\nà nouveau pour terminer. `publish --domain` accepte ensuite ce domaine ou tout sous-domaine à un seul label.\nLes noms générés utilisent <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh et ne nécessitent aucune vérification.\nL'accès est attribué par défaut à l'équipe propriétaire ou au propriétaire personnel. Les autorisations par e-mail s'appliquent à un seul port.\nL'accès public nécessite une confirmation ; --yes le confirme pour les scripts. Ajoutez --json pour une sortie au format JSON."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الاستخدام:\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\nتحقق من النطاق الذي تملكه أولاً: يطبع `verify` سجلات DNS المراد إضافتها، ثم قم بتشغيله\nمرة أخرى للإكمال. يقبل `publish --domain` بعد ذلك هذا النطاق أو أي نطاق فرعي من مستوى واحد (one-label).\nتستخدم الأسماء التي تم إنشاؤها الصيغة <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh ولا تحتاج إلى تحقق.\nيتم تعيين الوصول افتراضيًا للفريق المالك أو المالك الشخصي. تنطبق صلاحيات البريد الإلكتروني على منفذ واحد فقط.\nالوصول العام يتطلب تأكيدًا؛ ويؤكده الخيار --yes للبرمجيات النصية (scripts). أضف --json لإخراج بتنسيق JSON."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uso:\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\nVerifica primero un dominio de tu propiedad: `verify` muestra los registros DNS que debes añadir, luego ejecútalo\nde nuevo para completarlo. `publish --domain` aceptará entonces ese dominio o cualquier subdominio de un solo nivel.\nLos nombres generados usan <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh y no necesitan verificación.\nEl acceso predeterminado es para el equipo propietario o el propietario personal. Las concesiones por correo electrónico se aplican a un solo puerto.\nEl acceso público requiere confirmación; --yes lo confirma para los scripts. Añade --json para obtener la salida en formato JSON."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法：\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\n請先驗證您擁有的網域：`verify` 會列印出要新增的 DNS 紀錄，然後再次執行它\n以完成驗證。接著 `publish --domain` 將接受該網域或任何單標籤子網域。\n產生的名稱會使用 <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh，且不需要驗證。\n存取權限預設為擁有的團隊或個人擁有者。Email 授權僅適用於單一連接埠。\n公開存取權限需要確認；--yes 可為指令碼進行確認。新增 --json 可輸出 JSON 格式。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "사용법:\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\n먼저 소유한 도메인을 확인하세요. `verify`는 추가할 DNS 레코드를 출력하며, 완료하려면 레코드를 추가한 뒤\n다시 실행하십시오. 이후 `publish --domain`에서 해당 도메인 또는 임의의 단일 레이블 하위 도메인을 사용할 수 있습니다.\n생성된 이름은 <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh 형식을 사용하며 별도의 확인이 필요하지 않습니다.\n액세스 기본값은 소유 팀 또는 개인 소유자입니다. 이메일 권한 부여(grants)는 단일 포트에만 적용됩니다.\n퍼블릭 액세스는 확인이 필요하며, --yes는 스크립트 실행 시 이를 확인 처리합니다. JSON 출력을 보려면 --json을 추가하세요."
          }
        },
        "bs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Upotreba:\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\nNajprije verificirajte domenu čiji ste vlasnik: `verify` ispisuje DNS zapise za dodavanje, zatim\nponovo pokrenite naredbu radi završetka. `publish --domain` tada prihvata tu domenu ili bilo koje dijete s jednom oznakom.\nGenerirana imena koriste <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh i ne trebaju verifikaciju.\nPristup se zadano postavlja na vlasničkim tim ili osobnog vlasnika. Dodjele e-pošte odnose se samo na jedan port.\nJavni pristup zahtijeva potvrdu; --yes to potvrđuje za skripte. Dodajte --json za JSON izlaz."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Brug:\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\nVerificér et domæne, du ejer, først: `verify` udskriver de DNS-poster, der skal tilføjes, kør det\nderefter igen for at fuldføre. `publish --domain` accepterer derefter det domæne eller et barn med ét label.\nGenererede navne bruger <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh og kræver ingen verificering.\nAdgang er som standard det ejende team eller den personlige ejer. E-mailrettigheder gælder kun én port.\nOffentlig adgang kræver bekræftelse; --yes bekræfter det til scripts. Tilføj --json for JSON-output."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Uso:\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\nVerifica prima un dominio di tua proprietà: `verify` mostra i record DNS da aggiungere, poi eseguilo\ndi nuovo per completare. `publish --domain` accetta quindi quel dominio o un qualsiasi figlio con una sola etichetta.\nI nomi generati usano <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh e non richiedono verifica.\nL'accesso predefinisce al team proprietario o al proprietario personale. I grant per email si applicano solo a una porta.\nL'accesso public richiede conferma; --yes la conferma per gli script. Aggiungi --json per output JSON."
          }
        },
        "km": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "ការប្រើប្រាស់:\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\nផ្ទៀងផ្ទាត់ domain ដែលអ្នកជាម្ចាស់ជាមុន: `verify` បោះពុម្ពកំណត់ត្រា DNS ដើម្បីបន្ថែម, បន្ទាប់មកដំណើរការ\nម្តងទៀតដើម្បីបញ្ចប់។ `publish --domain` ទទួលយក domain នោះ ឬ child មួយ label ណាមួយ។\nឈ្មោះដែលបង្កើតស្វ័យប្រវត្តិប្រើ <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh ហើយមិនត្រូវការផ្ទៀងផ្ទាត់។\nAccess លំនាំដើមទៅ team ម្ចាស់ ឬម្ចាស់ personal។ Email grants អនុវត្តចំពោះ port មួយប៉ុណ្ណោះ។\nPublic access ត្រូវការការបញ្ជាក់; --yes បញ្ជាក់វាសម្រាប់ script។ បន្ថែម --json សម្រាប់លទ្ធផល JSON។"
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Bruk:\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\nVerifiser et domene du eier først: `verify` skriver ut DNS-postene som skal legges til, kjør deretter\nkommandoen igjen for å fullføre. `publish --domain` godtar deretter det domenet eller ett underpunkt med én etikett.\nGenererte navn bruker <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh og trenger ingen verifisering.\nTilgang er som standard det eiende teamet eller personlig eier. E-posttillatelser gjelder kun én port.\nOffentlig tilgang krever bekreftelse; --yes bekrefter det for skript. Legg til --json for JSON-utdata."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Użycie:\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\nNajpierw zweryfikuj posiadaną domenę: `verify` wyświetla rekordy DNS do dodania, następnie uruchom ponownie,\naby zakończyć. `publish --domain` akceptuje tę domenę lub dowolne dziecko z jedną etykietą.\nWygenerowane nazwy używają <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh i nie wymagają weryfikacji.\nDostęp domyślnie należy do właściciela zespołu lub osobistego. Uprawnienia e-mail dotyczą tylko jednego portu.\nDostęp public wymaga potwierdzenia; --yes potwierdza go w skryptach. Dodaj --json dla wyjścia JSON."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Uso:\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\nVerifique primeiro um domínio de sua propriedade: `verify` exibe os registros DNS a adicionar, então execute\nnovamente para concluir. `publish --domain` aceita esse domínio ou qualquer filho com um único rótulo.\nNomes gerados usam <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh e não precisam de verificação.\nO acesso padrão é o team proprietário ou o dono pessoal. Concessões por e-mail se aplicam a apenas uma porta.\nO acesso público requer confirmação; --yes confirma para scripts. Adicione --json para saída JSON."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Использование:\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\nСначала подтвердите владение доменом: `verify` выведет DNS-записи для добавления, затем\nзапустите его снова для завершения. `publish --domain` принимает этот домен или любой дочерний с одной меткой.\nСгенерированные имена используют <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh и не требуют подтверждения.\nДоступ по умолчанию — владеющая команда или личный владелец. Гранты по email применяются только к одному порту.\nПубличный доступ требует подтверждения; --yes подтверждает для скриптов. Добавьте --json для вывода в JSON."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Usage:\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\nยืนยันโดเมนของคุณก่อน: `verify` แสดง DNS records ที่ต้องเพิ่ม จากนั้นรันอีกครั้ง\nเพื่อยืนยัน `publish --domain` รับโดเมนนั้นหรือ child หนึ่ง label ได้\nชื่อที่สร้างอัตโนมัติใช้รูปแบบ <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh ไม่ต้องยืนยัน\nAccess เริ่มต้นเป็น team เจ้าของหรือเจ้าของส่วนตัว grant ทาง email ใช้ได้กับหนึ่งพอร์ตเท่านั้น\nPublic access ต้องยืนยัน; --yes ยืนยันอัตโนมัติสำหรับสคริปต์ เพิ่ม --json สำหรับ JSON output"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Kullanım:\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\nÖnce sahip olduğunuz bir etki alanını doğrulayın: `verify` eklenecek DNS kayıtlarını yazdırır,\ntamamlamak için tekrar çalıştırın. Ardından `publish --domain` bu etki alanını veya tek etiketli alt alanı kabul eder.\nOluşturulan adlar <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh biçimini kullanır ve doğrulama gerektirmez.\nErişim varsayılan olarak sahip team veya bireysel sahibe aittir. E-posta izinleri yalnızca tek port için geçerlidir.\nPublic erişim onay gerektirir; --yes bunu betikler için onaylar. JSON çıktısı için --json ekleyin."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Використання:\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\nСпочатку підтвердіть власний домен: `verify` виводить DNS-записи для додавання, потім\nзапустіть знову для завершення. `publish --domain` приймає цей домен або будь-який дочірній з одним міткою.\nЗгенеровані імена використовують <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh і не потребують підтвердження.\nДоступ за замовчуванням — команда-власник або особистий власник. Email-гранти діють лише для одного порту.\nПублічний доступ вимагає підтвердження; --yes підтверджує для скриптів. Додайте --json для виведення JSON."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cách dùng:\n  cmux cloud domains [list]\n  cmux cloud domains zones\n  cmux cloud domains verify <domain>\n  cmux cloud domains publish <vm> <port> [--domain <hostname>] [--access personal|team|public] [--team <id>] [--org-slug <slug>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains access <hostname> <personal|team|public> [--team <id>] [--yes]\n  cmux cloud domains grant <hostname> <email> [--expires <ISO-date>]\n  cmux cloud domains ungrant <hostname> <email>\n  cmux cloud domains grants <hostname>\n  cmux cloud domains rm <hostname>\n\nXác minh tên miền bạn sở hữu trước: `verify` in ra các bản ghi DNS cần thêm, sau đó chạy lại\nđể hoàn tất. `publish --domain` sẽ chấp nhận tên miền đó hoặc tên miền con một nhãn.\nTên được tạo tự động có dạng <vm>--<organization>--<port>.cmux.sh và không cần xác minh.\nAccess mặc định theo team sở hữu hoặc chủ sở hữu cá nhân. Cấp quyền email chỉ áp dụng cho một cổng.\nPublic access yêu cầu xác nhận; --yes xác nhận cho script. Thêm --json để xuất JSON."
          }
        }
      }
    },
