    "cli.surface.usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n       cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n       cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n       cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal: the surface catalog. Terminals, VNC screens and browsers\non This Mac and on every cloud machine are resources (`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`,\ne.g. local/terminal/<uuid>, vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…, vivid-newt/display/display:1,\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000); panes project them. `open` reuses the pane already\nshowing a resource unless --new; --pane with a side splits that pane on that side,\n--tab adds a tab to it. A local terminal moves to the destination (it is shown once).\n`new-terminal` creates a terminal on the machine (cloud: in its cmux-tui session).\n`cmux vm tree` prints the same catalog.\n\nresume: attach restart command metadata to a terminal surface.\nPublic CLI bindings are stored for inspection and manual restore.\n\nFlags:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   Workspace context (default: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     Surface context (default: $CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      Window context for workspace and surface refs/indexes\n  --cwd <path>             Working directory for restore (default: $PWD)\n  --name <name>            Display name for the binding\n  --kind <kind>            Binding kind, for example agent or tmux\n  --checkpoint <id>        Provider checkpoint or session id\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     Same as --checkpoint and takes precedence\n  --source <source>        Binding source label\n\nExamples:\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用法: cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n       cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n       cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n       cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal: サーフェスカタログを操作します。この Mac と各クラウドマシンの\nターミナル、VNC 画面、ブラウザはリソースです（`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`。例:\nlocal/terminal/<uuid>、vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…、vivid-newt/display/display:1、\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000）。ペインはこれらを表示します。`open` は --new を指定しない限り\n同じリソースを表示中のペインを再利用します。--pane と方向を指定するとその方向に分割し、\n--tab はタブを追加します。ローカルターミナルは移動先へ移され、同時に 1 か所だけで表示されます。\n`new-terminal` はマシン上にターミナルを作成します（クラウドでは cmux-tui セッション内）。\n`cmux vm tree` も同じカタログを表示します。\n\nresume: ターミナルサーフェスに再起動コマンドのメタデータを関連付けます。\n公開 CLI バインディングは確認と手動復元のために保存されます。\n\nフラグ:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   ワークスペースのコンテキスト（既定: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID）\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     サーフェスのコンテキスト（既定: $CMUX_SURFACE_ID）\n  --window <id|ref|index>      ワークスペースとサーフェスの参照・番号に使うウィンドウ\n  --cwd <path>             復元時の作業ディレクトリ（既定: $PWD）\n  --name <name>            バインディングの表示名\n  --kind <kind>            バインディング種別（例: agent、tmux）\n  --checkpoint <id>        プロバイダのチェックポイントまたはセッション ID\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     --checkpoint と同じ（こちらを優先）\n  --source <source>        バインディングのソースラベル\n\n例:\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法：cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n       cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n       cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n       cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal：表面目录。本机与每台云端机器上的终端、VNC 屏幕和浏览器\n都是资源（`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`，例如 local/terminal/<uuid>、\nvivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…、vivid-newt/display/display:1、\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000）；窗格是它们的投影。除非加 --new，`open` 会复用\n已显示该资源的窗格；--pane 配合方向会把该窗格朝那一侧拆分，--tab 则给它加一个标签页。\n本机终端会移动到目标位置（它同时只显示一处）。\n`new-terminal` 会在该机器上创建终端（云端：在其 cmux-tui 会话中）。\n`cmux vm tree` 打印同一份目录。\n\nresume：为终端表面附加重启命令元数据。\n公开的 CLI 绑定会被存储，供查看和手动恢复。\n\n标志:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   工作区上下文（默认：$CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID）\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     表面上下文（默认：$CMUX_SURFACE_ID）\n  --window <id|ref|index>      工作区与表面引用/索引的窗口上下文\n  --cwd <path>             恢复时使用的工作目录（默认：$PWD）\n  --name <name>            该绑定的显示名称\n  --kind <kind>            绑定类型，例如 agent 或 tmux\n  --checkpoint <id>        提供方的检查点或会话 id\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     与 --checkpoint 相同，且优先级更高\n  --source <source>        绑定来源标签\n\n示例:\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verwendung: cmux surface ls [<Maschine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n       cmux surface open <Ressource> [--workspace <ID|Ref|Index>] [--pane <ID|Ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n       cmux surface new-terminal --machine <ID|local> [--cwd <Verzeichnis>] [--name <Name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <ID|Ref|Index>] [--no-open] [-- <Befehl...>]\n       cmux surface resume set [Flags] -- <Argv...>\n       cmux surface resume set [Flags] --shell <Befehl>\n       cmux surface resume show [--json] [Flags]\n       cmux surface resume get [--json] [Flags]\n       cmux surface resume clear [Flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal: Der Oberflächenkatalog. Terminals, VNC-Bildschirme und Browser\nauf diesem Mac und auf jeder Cloud-Maschine sind Ressourcen (`<Maschine>/<Art>/<Schlüssel>`,\nz. B. local/terminal/<UUID>, vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…, vivid-newt/display/display:1,\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000); Teilfenster projizieren sie. `open` verwendet das Teilfenster, das bereits\neine Ressource anzeigt, wieder, es sei denn, --new wird verwendet; --pane mit einer Richtungsangabe teilt dieses Teilfenster auf dieser Seite auf,\n--tab fügt ihm einen Tab hinzu. Ein lokales Terminal verschiebt sich an das Ziel (es wird einmal angezeigt).\n`new-terminal` erstellt ein Terminal auf der Maschine (Cloud: in ihrer cmux-tui-Sitzung).\n`cmux vm tree` gibt denselben Katalog aus.\n\nresume: Startbefehl-Metadaten an eine Terminal-Oberfläche anhängen.\nÖffentliche CLI-Bindungen werden zur Überprüfung und manuellen Wiederherstellung gespeichert.\n\nFlags:\n  --workspace <ID|Ref|Index>   Kontext des Arbeitsbereichs (Standard: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <ID|Ref|Index>     Kontext der Oberfläche (Standard: $CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <ID|Ref|Index>      Fensterkontext für Arbeitsbereichs- und Oberflächen-Referenzen/-Indizes\n  --cwd <Pfad>             Arbeitsverzeichnis für die Wiederherstellung (Standard: $PWD)\n  --name <Name>            Anzeigename für die Bindung\n  --kind <Art>            Art der Bindung, zum Beispiel agent oder tmux\n  --checkpoint <ID>        Anbieter-Prüfpunkt oder Sitzungs-ID\n  --checkpoint-id <ID>     Gleich wie --checkpoint und hat Vorrang\n  --source <Quelle>        Quelle der Bindung (Label)\n\nBeispiele:\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n       cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n       cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n       cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal : le catalogue des surfaces d’affichage. Les terminaux, écrans VNC et navigateurs\nsur Ce Mac et sur chaque machine cloud sont des ressources (`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`,\npar ex. local/terminal/<uuid>, vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…, vivid-newt/display/display:1,\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000) ; les volets les projettent. `open` réutilise le volet affichant\ndéjà une ressource sauf si --new ; --pane avec un côté divise ce volet de ce côté,\n--tab lui ajoute un onglet. Un terminal local se déplace vers la destination (il n’est affiché qu’une seule fois).\n`new-terminal` crée un terminal sur la machine (cloud : dans sa session cmux-tui).\n`cmux vm tree` affiche le même catalogue.\n\nresume : associe des métadonnées de commande de redémarrage à une surface d’affichage de terminal.\nLes liaisons CLI publiques sont stockées pour inspection et restauration manuelle.\n\nFlags :\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   Contexte de l'espace de travail (par défaut : $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     Contexte de la surface d'affichage (par défaut : $CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      Contexte de la fenêtre pour les réf/index d'espace de travail et de surface d'affichage\n  --cwd <path>             Répertoire de travail pour la restauration (par défaut : $PWD)\n  --name <name>            Nom d'affichage pour la liaison\n  --kind <kind>            Type de liaison, par exemple agent ou tmux\n  --checkpoint <id>        Point de contrôle du fournisseur ou ID de session\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     Identique à --checkpoint et a la priorité\n  --source <source>        Étiquette de la source de liaison\n\nExemples :\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الاستخدام: cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n       cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n       cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n       cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal: كتالوج الأسطح. الطرفيات، وشاشات VNC، والمتصفحات\nعلى This Mac وعلى كل جهاز سحابي هي موارد (`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`،\nعلى سبيل المثال local/terminal/<uuid>، أو vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…، أو vivid-newt/display/display:1،\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000)؛ الأجزاء تعرضهم. يعيد الأمر `open` استخدام الجزء الذي يعرض\nموردًا بالفعل ما لم يتم تمرير --new؛ وتمرير --pane مع تحديد جانب يقسم ذلك الجزء على ذلك الجانب،\nوتمرير --tab يضيف علامة تبويب إليه. تنتقل الطرفية المحلية إلى الوجهة (تُعرض مرة واحدة).\nينشئ الأمر `new-terminal` طرفية على الجهاز (في السحابة: في جلسة cmux-tui الخاصة به).\nيطبع الأمر `cmux vm tree` الكتالوج نفسه.\n\nresume: إرفاق بيانات تعريف أمر إعادة التشغيل بسطح طرفية.\nتُخزن ارتباطات واجهة CLI العامة للفحص والاستعادة اليدوية.\n\nالعلامات:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   سياق مساحة العمل (الافتراضي: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     سياق السطح (الافتراضي: $CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      سياق النافذة لمراجع/فهارس مساحة العمل والسطح\n  --cwd <path>             مجلد العمل للاستعادة (الافتراضي: $PWD)\n  --name <name>            الاسم المعروض للارتباط\n  --kind <kind>            نوع الارتباط، على سبيل المثال agent أو tmux\n  --checkpoint <id>        نقطة تفتيش الموفر أو معرف الجلسة\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     مطابق لـ --checkpoint وله الأولوية\n  --source <source>        ملصق مصدر الارتباط\n\nأمثلة:\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uso: cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n       cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n       cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n       cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal: el catálogo de superficies. Terminales, pantallas VNC y navegadores\nen Este Mac y en cada máquina en la nube son recursos (`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`,\npor ejemplo, local/terminal/<uuid>, vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…, vivid-newt/display/display:1,\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000); los paneles los proyectan. `open` reutiliza el panel que ya\nmuestra un recurso a menos que se use --new; --pane con un lado divide ese panel en ese lado,\n--tab le añade una pestaña. Una terminal local se mueve al destino (se muestra una sola vez).\n`new-terminal` crea una terminal en la máquina (nube: en su sesión cmux-tui).\n`cmux vm tree` muestra el mismo catálogo.\n\nresume: asocia metadatos de comandos de reinicio a una superficie de terminal.\nLas vinculaciones públicas de la CLI se guardan para su inspección y restauración manual.\n\nOpciones:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   Contexto del espacio de trabajo (predeterminado: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     Contexto de la superficie (predeterminado: $CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      Contexto de la ventana para referencias/índices de espacios de trabajo y superficies\n  --cwd <path>             Directorio de trabajo para restaurar (predeterminado: $PWD)\n  --name <name>            Nombre para mostrar de la vinculación\n  --kind <kind>            Tipo de vinculación, por ejemplo agent o tmux\n  --checkpoint <id>        Punto de control del proveedor o id de sesión\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     Igual que --checkpoint y tiene precedencia\n  --source <source>        Etiqueta de origen de la vinculación\n\nEjemplos:\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法：cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n       cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n       cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n       cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal：介面目錄。這部 Mac 及所有雲端機器上的\n終端機、VNC 螢幕和瀏覽器皆為資源 (`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`，\n例如：local/terminal/<uuid>、vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…、vivid-newt/display/display:1、\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000)；窗格會對它們進行投影。`open` 會重複使用已經\n顯示該資源的窗格 (除非指定 --new)；附帶側邊方向的 --pane 會在該側分割該窗格，\n--tab 則會對其新增一個標籤頁。本機終端機會移動到目的地 (它只會顯示一次)。\n`new-terminal` 會在機器上建立一個終端機 (雲端：在其 cmux-tui 工作階段中)。\n`cmux vm tree` 會列印相同的目錄。\n\nresume：將重新啟動命令的中繼資料附加至終端機介面。\n公開的 CLI 綁定會儲存以供檢視和手動還原。\n\n旗標：\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   工作區上下文 (預設值：$CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     介面上下文 (預設值：$CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      工作區與介面引用/索引的視窗上下文\n  --cwd <path>             用於還原的工作目錄 (預設值：$PWD)\n  --name <name>            綁定的顯示名稱\n  --kind <kind>            綁定種類，例如 agent 或 tmux\n  --checkpoint <id>        提供者檢查點或工作階段識別碼\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     與 --checkpoint 相同且優先適用\n  --source <source>        綁定來源標籤\n\n範例：\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "사용법: cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n       cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n       cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n       cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal: 화면 카탈로그. 이 Mac 및 모든 클라우드 머신의 터미널, VNC 화면 및 브라우저는\n리소스(`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`,\n예: local/terminal/<uuid>, vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…, vivid-newt/display/display:1,\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000)이며, 분할 창이 이를 보여줍니다. `open`은 --new가 없는 한 리소스를 이미 보여주고 있는 분할 창을\n재사용합니다. 방향이 지정된 --pane은 해당 방향으로 해당 분할 창을 분할하고,\n--tab은 여기에 탭을 추가합니다. 로컬 터미널은 대상 위치로 이동합니다 (한 번만 표시됨).\n`new-terminal`은 머신에 터미널을 생성합니다 (클라우드: cmux-tui 세션 내부).\n`cmux vm tree`도 동일한 카탈로그를 출력합니다.\n\nresume: 터미널 화면에 재시작 명령 메타데이터를 추가합니다.\n공공 CLI 바인딩은 검사 및 수동 복구를 위해 저장됩니다.\n\n플래그:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   작업 공간 컨텍스트 (기본값: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     화면 컨텍스트 (기본값: $CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      작업 공간 및 화면 참조/인덱스를 위한 창 컨텍스트\n  --cwd <path>             복구용 작업 디렉토리 (기본값: $PWD)\n  --name <name>            바인딩에 표시할 이름\n  --kind <kind>            바인딩 종류 (예: agent 또는 tmux)\n  --checkpoint <id>        제공자 체크포인트 또는 세션 ID\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     --checkpoint와 동일하며 우선 적용됩니다\n  --source <source>        바인딩 소스 레이블\n\n예시:\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "bs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Upotreba: cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n       cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n       cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n       cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal: katalog površina. Terminali, VNC ekrani i preglednici\nna ovom Macu i na svakom cloud računalu su resursi (`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`,\nnpr. local/terminal/<uuid>, vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…, vivid-newt/display/display:1,\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000); okna ih projiciraju. `open` ponovo koristi okno koje već\nprikazuje resurs osim s --new; --pane s prikazom dijeli to okno na toj strani,\n--tab dodaje tab. Lokalni terminal se premješta na odredište (prikazuje se jedanput).\n`new-terminal` kreira terminal na računalu (cloud: u njegovoj cmux-tui sesiji).\n`cmux vm tree` ispisuje isti katalog.\n\nresume: prikvači metapodatke naredbe za ponovni pokretanje na terminalnu površinu.\nJavne CLI veze se čuvaju radi inspekcije i ručnog vraćanja.\n\nZastavice:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   Kontekst radnog prostora (zadano: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     Kontekst površine (zadano: $CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      Kontekst prozora za reference/indekse radnog prostora i površine\n  --cwd <path>             Radni direktorij za vraćanje (zadano: $PWD)\n  --name <name>            Prikazni naziv za vezu\n  --kind <kind>            Vrsta veze, npr. agent ili tmux\n  --checkpoint <id>        Checkpoint ili id sesije provajdera\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     Isto kao --checkpoint i ima prednost\n  --source <source>        Oznaka izvora veze\n\nPrimjeri:\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Brug: cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n       cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n       cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n       cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal: overfladekataloget. Terminaler, VNC-skærme og browsere\npå denne Mac og på alle cloud-maskiner er ressourcer (`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`,\nf.eks. local/terminal/<uuid>, vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…, vivid-newt/display/display:1,\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000); ruder projicerer dem. `open` genbruger ruden, der allerede\nviser en ressource, medmindre --new angives; --pane med en side deler den rude på den side,\n--tab tilføjer en fane til den. En lokal terminal flyttes til destinationen (vises én gang).\n`new-terminal` opretter en terminal på maskinen (cloud: i dens cmux-tui-session).\n`cmux vm tree` udskriver samme katalog.\n\nresume: tilknyt metadata om genstartskommando til en terminaloverflade.\nOffentlige CLI-bindinger gemmes til inspektion og manuel gendannelse.\n\nFlag:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   Arbejdsområdekontekst (standard: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     Overfladekonkekst (standard: $CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      Vindueskonkekst for arbejdsområde- og overfladerefs/indekser\n  --cwd <path>             Arbejdsmappe til gendannelse (standard: $PWD)\n  --name <name>            Vist navn for bindingen\n  --kind <kind>            Bindingstype, f.eks. agent eller tmux\n  --checkpoint <id>        Udbydercheckpoint eller sessions-id\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     Samme som --checkpoint og har forrang\n  --source <source>        Bindingskildelabel\n\nEksempler:\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Utilizzo: cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n         cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n         cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n         cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n         cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n         cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n         cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n         cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal: il catalogo delle surface. Terminali, schermi VNC e browser\nsu questo Mac e su ogni macchina cloud sono risorse (`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`,\nes. local/terminal/<uuid>, vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…, vivid-newt/display/display:1,\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000); i pannelli le proiettano. `open` riutilizza il pannello già\nvisualizzato per una risorsa, a meno di --new; --pane con un lato divide quel pannello su quel lato,\n--tab aggiunge una scheda. Un terminale locale si sposta alla destinazione (viene mostrato una sola volta).\n`new-terminal` crea un terminale sulla macchina (cloud: nella sua sessione cmux-tui).\n`cmux vm tree` stampa lo stesso catalogo.\n\nresume: collega metadati del comando di riavvio a una surface terminale.\nI binding pubblici della CLI vengono salvati per ispezione e ripristino manuale.\n\nFlag:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   Contesto workspace (predefinito: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     Contesto surface (predefinito: $CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      Contesto finestra per i ref/indici di workspace e surface\n  --cwd <path>             Directory di lavoro per il ripristino (predefinito: $PWD)\n  --name <name>            Nome visualizzato per il binding\n  --kind <kind>            Tipo di binding, ad esempio agent o tmux\n  --checkpoint <id>        Checkpoint del provider o id di sessione\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     Come --checkpoint, ha la precedenza\n  --source <source>        Etichetta sorgente del binding\n\nEsempi:\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "km": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Usage: cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n       cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n       cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n       cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal: កាតាឡុក surface។ Terminal, VNC screen និង browser\nនៅ Mac នេះ និងម៉ាស៊ីន cloud គ្រប់台 សុទ្ធជា resource (`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`,\nឧ. local/terminal/<uuid>, vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…, vivid-newt/display/display:1,\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000); pane បង្ហាញពួកវា។ `open` ប្រើ pane ដែល\nកំពុងបង្ហាញ resource ឡើងវិញ លុះត្រាមាន --new; --pane ជាមួយទិស ចែក pane នោះ,\n--tab បន្ថែម tab ទៅវា។ terminal local ផ្លាស់ទៅ destination (បង្ហាញម្ដង)។\n`new-terminal` បង្កើត terminal នៅម៉ាស៊ីន (cloud: នៅ session cmux-tui របស់វា)។\n`cmux vm tree` បោះពុម្ពកាតាឡុកដូចគ្នា។\n\nresume: ភ្ជាប់ metadata នៃពាក្យបញ្ជារចាប់ផ្ដើមឡើងវិញទៅ surface terminal។\nBinding CLI សាធារណៈត្រូវរក្សាទុកសម្រាប់ពិនិត្យ និងស្ដារដោយដៃ។\n\nFlags:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   បរិបទ Workspace (លំនាំដើម: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     បរិបទ Surface (លំនាំដើម: $CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      បរិបទ Window សម្រាប់ ref/index workspace និង surface\n  --cwd <path>             ថតការងារសម្រាប់ restore (លំនាំដើម: $PWD)\n  --name <name>            ឈ្មោះបង្ហាញសម្រាប់ binding\n  --kind <kind>            ប្រភេទ binding ឧទាហរណ៍ agent ឬ tmux\n  --checkpoint <id>        checkpoint ឬ id session របស់ provider\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     ដូច --checkpoint ហើយមានអាទិភាពជាង\n  --source <source>        ស្លាកប្រភព binding\n\nExamples:\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Bruk: cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n       cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n       cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n       cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal: overflatekataloget. Terminaler, VNC-skjermer og nettlesere\npå denne Macen og på alle skymaskiner er ressurser (`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`,\nf.eks. local/terminal/<uuid>, vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…, vivid-newt/display/display:1,\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000); ruter viser dem. `open` gjenbruker ruten som allerede\nviser en ressurs med mindre --new er angitt; --pane med en retning deler ruten på den siden,\n--tab legger til en fane. En lokal terminal flyttes til målet (den vises én gang).\n`new-terminal` oppretter en terminal på maskinen (sky: i dens cmux-tui-sesjon).\n`cmux vm tree` skriver ut samme katalog.\n\nresume: knytt metadata for omstartskommando til en terminaloverflate.\nOffentlige CLI-bindinger lagres for inspeksjon og manuell gjenoppretting.\n\nFlagg:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   Arbeidsområdekontekst (standard: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     Overlatekontekst (standard: $CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      Vinduskontekst for arbeidsområde- og overflateferanser/indekser\n  --cwd <path>             Arbeidsmappe for gjenoppretting (standard: $PWD)\n  --name <name>            Visningsnavn for bindingen\n  --kind <kind>            Bindingstype, for eksempel agent eller tmux\n  --checkpoint <id>        Leverandørens sjekkpunkt eller sesjons-id\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     Samme som --checkpoint og har forrang\n  --source <source>        Bindingskildemerke\n\nEksempler:\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Użycie: cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n       cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n       cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n       cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal: katalog powierzchni. Terminale, ekrany VNC i przeglądarki\nna tym Macu i na każdej maszynie chmurowej są zasobami (`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`,\nnp. local/terminal/<uuid>, vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…, vivid-newt/display/display:1,\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000); panele je prezentują. `open` ponownie używa panelu\nwyświetlającego dany zasób, chyba że podano --new; --pane z kierunkiem dzieli ten panel\npo wskazanej stronie, --tab dodaje do niego kartę. Lokalny terminal przenosi się do miejsca\ndocelowego (jest wyświetlany raz). `new-terminal` tworzy terminal na maszynie\n(chmura: w jej sesji cmux-tui). `cmux vm tree` wyświetla ten sam katalog.\n\nresume: dołącz metadane polecenia restartu do powierzchni terminalu.\nPubliczne powiązania CLI są przechowywane do inspekcji i ręcznego przywracania.\n\nFlagi:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   Kontekst obszaru roboczego (domyślnie: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     Kontekst powierzchni (domyślnie: $CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      Kontekst okna dla referencji/indeksów obszaru roboczego i powierzchni\n  --cwd <path>             Katalog roboczy do przywracania (domyślnie: $PWD)\n  --name <name>            Nazwa wyświetlana powiązania\n  --kind <kind>            Rodzaj powiązania, np. agent lub tmux\n  --checkpoint <id>        Punkt kontrolny dostawcy lub id sesji\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     To samo co --checkpoint, ma pierwszeństwo\n  --source <source>        Etykieta źródła powiązania\n\nPrzykłady:\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Uso: cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n     cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n     cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n     cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n     cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n     cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n     cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n     cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal: o catálogo de surfaces. Terminais, telas VNC e navegadores\nneste Mac e em cada máquina cloud são recursos (`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`,\nexemplo: local/terminal/<uuid>, vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…, vivid-newt/display/display:1,\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000); os painéis os projetam. `open` reutiliza o painel que já\nexibe um recurso, a menos que --new seja usado; --pane com um lado divide o painel naquele lado,\n--tab adiciona uma aba a ele. Um terminal local move-se para o destino (é exibido uma vez).\n`new-terminal` cria um terminal na máquina (cloud: em sua sessão cmux-tui).\n`cmux vm tree` exibe o mesmo catálogo.\n\nresume: anexa metadados de comando de reinicialização a uma surface de terminal.\nAs vinculações públicas de CLI são armazenadas para inspeção e restauração manual.\n\nFlags:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   Contexto do workspace (padrão: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     Contexto da surface (padrão: $CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      Contexto de janela para refs/índices de workspace e surface\n  --cwd <path>             Diretório de trabalho para restauração (padrão: $PWD)\n  --name <name>            Nome de exibição para a vinculação\n  --kind <kind>            Tipo de vinculação, por exemplo agent ou tmux\n  --checkpoint <id>        Checkpoint do provedor ou id de sessão\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     Igual a --checkpoint e tem precedência\n  --source <source>        Rótulo de origem da vinculação\n\nExemplos:\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Использование: cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n       cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n       cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n       cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal: каталог поверхностей. Терминалы, экраны VNC и браузеры\nна этом Mac и на каждой облачной машине являются ресурсами (`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`,\nнапр. local/terminal/<uuid>, vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…, vivid-newt/display/display:1,\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000); панели их отображают. `open` повторно использует уже\nотображающую ресурс панель, если не указан --new; --pane со стороной разделяет эту панель\nпо этой стороне, --tab добавляет к ней вкладку. Локальный терминал перемещается к цели\n(отображается однократно). `new-terminal` создаёт терминал на машине (cloud: в её cmux-tui сессии).\n`cmux vm tree` выводит тот же каталог.\n\nresume: привязка метаданных команды перезапуска к поверхности терминала.\nПубличные привязки CLI сохраняются для просмотра и ручного восстановления.\n\nФлаги:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   Контекст рабочего пространства (по умолчанию: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     Контекст поверхности (по умолчанию: $CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      Контекст окна для ссылок/индексов рабочего пространства и поверхности\n  --cwd <path>             Рабочий каталог для восстановления (по умолчанию: $PWD)\n  --name <name>            Отображаемое имя привязки\n  --kind <kind>            Тип привязки, например agent или tmux\n  --checkpoint <id>        Контрольная точка провайдера или идентификатор сессии\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     То же, что --checkpoint, имеет приоритет\n  --source <source>        Метка источника привязки\n\nПримеры:\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "การใช้งาน: cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n       cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n       cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n       cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal: แคตตาล็อก surface ได้แก่ terminal, หน้าจอ VNC และเบราว์เซอร์\nบน Mac เครื่องนี้และบนเครื่อง cloud ทุกเครื่องถือเป็น resource (`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`,\nเช่น local/terminal/<uuid>, vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…, vivid-newt/display/display:1,\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000) โดย pane จะแสดง resource เหล่านั้น `open` จะนำ pane ที่\nแสดง resource อยู่แล้วมาใช้ซ้ำ เว้นแต่จะใช้ --new; --pane พร้อมทิศทางจะแยก pane นั้น\n--tab จะเพิ่ม tab ให้กับ pane นั้น terminal ในเครื่องจะย้ายไปยังปลายทาง (แสดงเพียงครั้งเดียว)\n`new-terminal` สร้าง terminal บนเครื่อง (cloud: ใน cmux-tui session ของเครื่องนั้น)\n`cmux vm tree` แสดงแคตตาล็อกเดียวกัน\n\nresume: แนบ metadata คำสั่งรีสตาร์ทเข้ากับ terminal surface\nการ binding CLI สาธารณะจะถูกเก็บไว้สำหรับการตรวจสอบและกู้คืนด้วยตนเอง\n\nFlags:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   บริบท workspace (ค่าเริ่มต้น: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     บริบท surface (ค่าเริ่มต้น: $CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      บริบท window สำหรับ ref/index ของ workspace และ surface\n  --cwd <path>             ไดเรกทอรีทำงานสำหรับการกู้คืน (ค่าเริ่มต้น: $PWD)\n  --name <name>            ชื่อที่แสดงสำหรับ binding\n  --kind <kind>            ประเภท binding เช่น agent หรือ tmux\n  --checkpoint <id>        checkpoint หรือ session id ของผู้ให้บริการ\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     เหมือนกับ --checkpoint และมีลำดับความสำคัญสูงกว่า\n  --source <source>        ป้ายกำกับแหล่งที่มาของ binding\n\nตัวอย่าง:\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Kullanım: cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n       cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n       cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n       cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n       cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n       cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal: yüzey kataloğu. Bu Mac'teki ve her bulut makinesindeki\nterminal, VNC ekranı ve tarayıcılar birer kaynaktır (`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`,\nörn. local/terminal/<uuid>, vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…, vivid-newt/display/display:1,\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000); bölmeler bunları yansıtır. `open`, --new belirtilmedikçe\nkaynağı zaten gösteren bölmeyi yeniden kullanır; --pane ile bir yön belirtilirse o bölme\nbölünür, --tab yeni sekme ekler. Yerel terminal hedefe taşınır (yalnızca bir kez gösterilir).\n`new-terminal` makinede terminal oluşturur (bulut: cmux-tui oturumunda).\n`cmux vm tree` aynı kataloğu yazdırır.\n\nresume: bir terminal yüzeyine yeniden başlatma komutu meta verisi ekler.\nGenel CLI bağlamaları inceleme ve manuel geri yükleme için saklanır.\n\nBayraklar:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   Çalışma alanı bağlamı (varsayılan: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     Yüzey bağlamı (varsayılan: $CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      Çalışma alanı ve yüzey ref/indeksleri için pencere bağlamı\n  --cwd <path>             Geri yükleme için çalışma dizini (varsayılan: $PWD)\n  --name <name>            Bağlama için görünen ad\n  --kind <kind>            Bağlama türü, örneğin agent veya tmux\n  --checkpoint <id>        Sağlayıcı kontrol noktası veya oturum kimliği\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     --checkpoint ile aynı, öncelik taşır\n  --source <source>        Bağlama kaynak etiketi\n\nÖrnekler:\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Використання: cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n              cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n              cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n              cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n              cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n              cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n              cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n              cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal: каталог поверхонь. Термінали, екрани VNC і браузери\nна цьому Mac та на кожній хмарній машині є ресурсами (`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`,\nнаприклад local/terminal/<uuid>, vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…, vivid-newt/display/display:1,\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000); панелі їх проектують. `open` повторно використовує панель, що вже\nвідображає ресурс, якщо не вказано --new; --pane зі стороною розділяє панель з того боку,\n--tab додає до неї вкладку. Локальний термінал переміщується до призначення (відображається один раз).\n`new-terminal` створює термінал на машині (cloud: у її сеансі cmux-tui).\n`cmux vm tree` виводить той самий каталог.\n\nresume: прикріплити метадані команди перезапуску до поверхні термінала.\nПублічні прив'язки CLI зберігаються для перегляду і ручного відновлення.\n\nПрапори:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   Контекст робочого простору (за замовчуванням: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     Контекст поверхні (за замовчуванням: $CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      Контекст вікна для посилань/індексів робочого простору і поверхні\n  --cwd <path>             Робочий каталог для відновлення (за замовчуванням: $PWD)\n  --name <name>            Відображувана назва прив'язки\n  --kind <kind>            Тип прив'язки, наприклад agent або tmux\n  --checkpoint <id>        Контрольна точка або ідентифікатор сеансу провайдера\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     Те саме, що --checkpoint, має пріоритет\n  --source <source>        Мітка джерела прив'язки\n\nПриклади:\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cách dùng: cmux surface ls [<machine>|local] [--refresh] [--json]\n         cmux surface open <resource> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--pane <id|ref>] [--left|--right|--up|--down|--tab] [--new] [--focus <true|false>]\n         cmux surface new-terminal --machine <id|local> [--cwd <dir>] [--name <name>] [--remote-workspace <ws_…>] [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--no-open] [-- <command...>]\n         cmux surface resume set [flags] -- <argv...>\n         cmux surface resume set [flags] --shell <command>\n         cmux surface resume show [--json] [flags]\n         cmux surface resume get [--json] [flags]\n         cmux surface resume clear [flags]\n\nls / open / new-terminal: danh mục surface. Terminal, màn hình VNC và trình duyệt\ntrên Mac này và trên mọi cloud machine đều là resource (`<machine>/<kind>/<key>`,\nvd. local/terminal/<uuid>, vivid-newt/terminal/term_2f9c…, vivid-newt/display/display:1,\nvivid-newt/browser/port:3000); pane hiển thị chúng. `open` dùng lại pane đang\nhiển thị resource trừ khi có --new; --pane với một hướng chia đôi pane theo hướng đó,\n--tab thêm tab vào pane. Terminal local chuyển đến đích (chỉ hiển thị một lần).\n`new-terminal` tạo terminal trên machine (cloud: trong phiên cmux-tui của nó).\n`cmux vm tree` in cùng danh mục đó.\n\nresume: gắn metadata lệnh khởi động lại vào terminal surface.\nCác ràng buộc CLI công khai được lưu để kiểm tra và khôi phục thủ công.\n\nFlags:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   Ngữ cảnh workspace (mặc định: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     Ngữ cảnh surface (mặc định: $CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      Ngữ cảnh window cho workspace và ref/index của surface\n  --cwd <path>             Thư mục làm việc khi khôi phục (mặc định: $PWD)\n  --name <name>            Tên hiển thị cho ràng buộc\n  --kind <kind>            Loại ràng buộc, ví dụ agent hoặc tmux\n  --checkpoint <id>        Checkpoint hoặc id phiên của provider\n  --checkpoint-id <id>     Tương tự --checkpoint và có độ ưu tiên cao hơn\n  --source <source>        Nhãn nguồn của ràng buộc\n\nVí dụ:\n  cmux surface resume set --kind tmux --shell \"tmux attach -t work\"\n  cmux surface resume set --kind opencode --checkpoint ses_123 -- opencode --session ses_123\n  cmux surface resume show --json"
          }
        }
      }
    },
