        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "사용법: cmux fork [--surface <id|ref>] <kind> <checkpoint-id>\n       cmux fork <kind> <checkpoint-id> --surface <id|ref>\n       cmux fork --surface=<id|ref> <kind> <checkpoint-id>\n       cmux fork --surface [id|ref]\n\n선택한 서피스의 저장된 세션에서 포크를 시작합니다."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bruk: cmux fork [--surface <id|ref>] <kind> <checkpoint-id>\n      cmux fork <kind> <checkpoint-id> --surface <id|ref>\n      cmux fork --surface=<id|ref> <kind> <checkpoint-id>\n      cmux fork --surface [id|ref]\n\nStart en fork fra den lagrede økten på den valgte overflaten."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Użycie: cmux fork [--surface <id|ref>] <kind> <checkpoint-id>\n        cmux fork <kind> <checkpoint-id> --surface <id|ref>\n        cmux fork --surface=<id|ref> <kind> <checkpoint-id>\n        cmux fork --surface [id|ref]\n\nUruchom fork z zapisanej sesji na wybranej powierzchni."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uso: cmux fork [--surface <id|ref>] <kind> <checkpoint-id>\n     cmux fork <kind> <checkpoint-id> --surface <id|ref>\n     cmux fork --surface=<id|ref> <kind> <checkpoint-id>\n     cmux fork --surface [id|ref]\n\nInicie um fork da sessão salva na superfície selecionada."
          }
