          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage:\n  cmux vm layout export <machine> [<workspace-id|name>] [--raw]\n                                                      Print a machine workspace's layout as a declarative layout\n                                                      document — the same JSON `cmux new-workspace --layout`,\n                                                      `cmux layout save/open`, and cmux.json use. Default: the\n                                                      machine's focused workspace. --raw prints the daemon's own\n                                                      LayoutDocument (exact pane/tab ids) instead.\n  cmux vm layout apply <machine> (<file>|- | --from-saved <name>) [--workspace <workspace-id>|--name <name>] [--cwd <dir>] [--open]\n                                                      Build panes, splits, and tabs on the machine from a layout\n                                                      document: a file, stdin (-), or a layout saved on this Mac\n                                                      (`cmux layout list`). Default: a NEW machine workspace named\n                                                      after the document (--name overrides); --workspace targets an\n                                                      existing EMPTY workspace. Terminal `command`s are typed into\n                                                      login shells started in each surface's `cwd` (relative to\n                                                      --cwd, default: the work user's home). --open then opens the workspace here\n                                                      with the same geometry.\n\nDocument (one of):\n  {\"pane\": {\"surfaces\": [{\"type\": \"terminal\", \"name\": \"tests\", \"command\": \"bun test\", \"cwd\": \"work/app\"}]}}\n  {\"direction\": \"horizontal\"|\"vertical\", \"split\": 0.6, \"children\": [<node>, <node>]}\n  {\"name\": …, \"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}      or      {\"name\": …, \"workspace\": {\"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}}\n`horizontal` = side by side (first child left), `vertical` = stacked (first child top); `split` is the\nfirst child's share (0.1–0.9, default 0.5). Surface types: terminal (name, command, cwd, env),\nbrowser (url, name); project surfaces are Mac-only and skipped on a machine.\nWorkspace ids come from `cmux vm tree`. Add --json for the raw result. Exit 2 = the document is invalid."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الاستخدام:\n  cmux vm layout export <machine> [<workspace-id|name>] [--raw]\n                                                      طباعة تخطيط مساحة عمل الجهاز كتخطيط تصريحي\n                                                      مستند — وهو نفس الـ JSON الذي يستخدمه `cmux new-workspace --layout`،\n                                                      و `cmux layout save/open` و cmux.json. الافتراضي:\n                                                      التي عليها التركيز للجهاز. يطبع --raw مستند التخطيط الخاص بالخادم الخفي نفسه\n                                                      LayoutDocument (معرّفات الألواح/علامات التبويب الدقيقة) بدلاً من ذلك.\n  cmux vm layout apply <machine> (<file>|- | --from-saved <name>) [--workspace <workspace-id>|--name <name>] [--cwd <dir>] [--open]\n                                                      بناء الألواح، والانقسامات، وعلامات التبويب على الجهاز من تخطيط\n                                                      مستند: ملف، أو stdin (-)، أو تخطيط محفوظ على جهاز Mac هذا\n                                                      (`cmux layout list`). الافتراضي: مساحة عمل جديدة للجهاز باسم\n                                                      المستند (يقوم --name بالتجاوز)؛ ويستهدف --workspace مساحة عمل\n                                                      فارغة EMPTY موجودة بالفعل. تُكتب `command` الخاصة بالطرفية في\n                                                      قشور تسجيل الدخول التي تبدأ في الـ `cwd` لكل سطح (بالنسبة إلى\n                                                      --cwd، الافتراضي: دليل منزل مستخدم العمل). ثم يفتح --open مساحة العمل هنا\n                                                      بنفس الأبعاد الهندسية.\n\nمستند (أحد ما يلي):\n  {\"pane\": {\"surfaces\": [{\"type\": \"terminal\", \"name\": \"tests\", \"command\": \"bun test\", \"cwd\": \"work/app\"}]}}\n  {\"direction\": \"horizontal\"|\"vertical\", \"split\": 0.6, \"children\": [<node>, <node>]}\n  {\"name\": …, \"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}      أو      {\"name\": …, \"workspace\": {\"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}}\n`horizontal` = جنبًا إلى جنب (الابن الأول يسارًا)، `vertical` = مكدس (الابن الأول بالأعلى)؛ و `split` يمثل حصة\nالابن الأول (0.1–0.9، الافتراضي 0.5). أنواع الأسطح: terminal (name, command, cwd, env)،\nو browser (url, name)؛ وأسطح المشاريع مخصصة لنظام Mac فقط ويتم تخطيها على الجهاز.\nتأتي معرفات مساحات العمل من `cmux vm tree`. أضف --json للحصول على النتيجة الخام. الرمز Exit 2 = المستند غير صالح."
          }
        },
        "bs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Upotreba:\n  cmux vm layout export <machine> [<workspace-id|name>] [--raw]\n                                                      Ispisuje raspored radnog prostora mašine kao deklarativni\n                                                      dokument rasporeda — isti JSON koji koriste `cmux new-workspace --layout`,\n                                                      `cmux layout save/open` i cmux.json. Zadano: fokusirani radni\n                                                      prostor mašine. --raw ispisuje daemon-ov vlastiti\n                                                      LayoutDocument (tačni ids okna/kartice).\n  cmux vm layout apply <machine> (<file>|- | --from-saved <name>) [--workspace <workspace-id>|--name <name>] [--cwd <dir>] [--open]\n                                                      Gradi okna, podjele i kartice na mašini prema dokumentu\n                                                      rasporeda: datoteka, stdin (-) ili raspored spremljen na ovom Macu\n                                                      (`cmux layout list`). Zadano: NOVI radni prostor mašine nazvan\n                                                      prema dokumentu (--name ima prednost); --workspace cilja\n                                                      postojeći PRAZAN radni prostor. Terminal `command`s se upisuju u\n                                                      login ljuske pokrenute u `cwd` svake površine (relativno prema\n                                                      --cwd, zadano: home direktorij radnog korisnika). --open zatim otvara radni prostor ovdje\n                                                      s istom geometrijom.\n\nDokument (jedno od):\n  {\"pane\": {\"surfaces\": [{\"type\": \"terminal\", \"name\": \"tests\", \"command\": \"bun test\", \"cwd\": \"work/app\"}]}}\n  {\"direction\": \"horizontal\"|\"vertical\", \"split\": 0.6, \"children\": [<node>, <node>]}\n  {\"name\": …, \"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}      ili      {\"name\": …, \"workspace\": {\"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}}\n`horizontal` = jedan pored drugog (prvo dijete lijevo), `vertical` = složeni (prvo dijete gore); `split` je\nudio prvog djeteta (0.1–0.9, zadano 0.5). Tipovi površina: terminal (name, command, cwd, env),\nbrowser (url, name); projektne površine su samo za Mac i preskačaju se na mašini.\nIds radnih prostora dolaze iz `cmux vm tree`. Dodajte --json za sirovi rezultat. Izlaz 2 = dokument je neispravan."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Brug:\n  cmux vm layout export <machine> [<workspace-id|name>] [--raw]\n                                                      Udskriv en maskines workspaces layout som et deklarativt\n                                                      layoutdokument — samme JSON som `cmux new-workspace --layout`,\n                                                      `cmux layout save/open` og cmux.json bruger. Standard: maskinens\n                                                      fokuserede workspace. --raw udskriver dæmonens egen\n                                                      LayoutDocument (eksakte pane/tab-id'er) i stedet.\n  cmux vm layout apply <machine> (<file>|- | --from-saved <name>) [--workspace <workspace-id>|--name <name>] [--cwd <dir>] [--open]\n                                                      Byg panes, splits og tabs på maskinen fra et layoutdokument:\n                                                      en fil, stdin (-) eller et layout gemt på denne Mac\n                                                      (`cmux layout list`). Standard: et NYT maskin-workspace navngivet\n                                                      efter dokumentet (--name tilsidesætter); --workspace målretter et\n                                                      eksisterende TOMT workspace. Terminal-`command`s skrives ind i\n                                                      login-shells startet i hver overflades `cwd` (relativt til\n                                                      --cwd, standard: work-brugerens hjem). --open åbner derefter workspacet her\n                                                      med samme geometri.\n\nDokument (én af):\n  {\"pane\": {\"surfaces\": [{\"type\": \"terminal\", \"name\": \"tests\", \"command\": \"bun test\", \"cwd\": \"work/app\"}]}}\n  {\"direction\": \"horizontal\"|\"vertical\", \"split\": 0.6, \"children\": [<node>, <node>]}\n  {\"name\": …, \"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}      or      {\"name\": …, \"workspace\": {\"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}}\n`horizontal` = side om side (første barn til venstre), `vertical` = stablet (første barn øverst); `split` er\nførste barns andel (0.1–0.9, standard 0.5). Overfladetyper: terminal (name, command, cwd, env),\nbrowser (url, name); project-overflader er kun til Mac og springes over på en maskine.\nWorkspace-id'er fås fra `cmux vm tree`. Tilføj --json for råresultatet. Exit 2 = dokumentet er ugyldigt."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verwendung:\n  cmux vm layout export <machine> [<workspace-id|name>] [--raw]\n                                                      Das Layout eines Maschinen-Arbeitsbereichs als deklaratives Layoutdokument\n                                                      ausgeben — dasselbe JSON, das `cmux new-workspace --layout`,\n                                                      `cmux layout save/open` und cmux.json verwenden. Standard: der\n                                                      fokussierte Arbeitsbereich der Maschine. --raw gibt stattdessen das eigene\n                                                      LayoutDocument des Daemons (exakte Bereichs-/Tab-IDs) aus.\n  cmux vm layout apply <machine> (<file>|- | --from-saved <name>) [--workspace <workspace-id>|--name <name>] [--cwd <dir>] [--open]\n                                                      Bereiche, Splits und Tabs auf der Maschine aus einem Layoutdokument\n                                                      erstellen: eine Datei, stdin (-) oder ein auf diesem Mac gespeichertes Layout\n                                                      (`cmux layout list`). Standard: ein NEUER Maschinen-Arbeitsbereich, benannt\n                                                      nach dem Dokument (--name überschreibt); --workspace zielt auf einen\n                                                      bestehenden LEEREN Arbeitsbereich ab. Terminal-`command`s werden in\n                                                      Login-Shells eingegeben, die im `cwd` jeder Oberfläche gestartet werden (relativ zu\n                                                      --cwd, Standard: das Home-Verzeichnis des Arbeitsbenutzers). --open öffnet dann den Arbeitsbereich hier\n                                                      mit derselben Geometrie.\n\nDokument (eines von):\n  {\"pane\": {\"surfaces\": [{\"type\": \"terminal\", \"name\": \"tests\", \"command\": \"bun test\", \"cwd\": \"work/app\"}]}}\n  {\"direction\": \"horizontal\"|\"vertical\", \"split\": 0.6, \"children\": [<node>, <node>]}\n  {\"name\": …, \"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}      oder      {\"name\": …, \"workspace\": {\"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}}\n`horizontal` = nebeneinander (erstes Child links), `vertical` = gestapelt (erstes Child oben); `split` ist der\nAnteil des ersten Childs (0.1–0.9, Standard 0.5). Oberflächentypen: terminal (name, command, cwd, env),\nbrowser (url, name); Projekt-Oberflächen sind nur für Mac verfügbar und werden auf einer Maschine übersprungen.\nArbeitsbereichs-IDs stammen aus `cmux vm tree`. Fügen Sie --json für das rohe Ergebnis hinzu. Exit 2 = das Dokument ist ungültig."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uso:\n  cmux vm layout export <machine> [<workspace-id|name>] [--raw]\n                                                      Imprime la distribución de un espacio de trabajo de la máquina como un documento de distribución\n                                                      declarativo — el mismo JSON que usan `cmux new-workspace --layout`,\n                                                      `cmux layout save/open` y cmux.json. Por defecto: el\n                                                      espacio de trabajo enfocado de la máquina. --raw imprime el propio\n                                                      LayoutDocument (identificadores exactos de paneles/pestañas) en su lugar.\n  cmux vm layout apply <machine> (<file>|- | --from-saved <name>) [--workspace <workspace-id>|--name <name>] [--cwd <dir>] [--open]\n                                                      Construye paneles, divisiones y pestañas en la máquina a partir de un documento\n                                                      de distribución: un archivo, la entrada estándar (-) o una distribución guardada en este Mac\n                                                      (`cmux layout list`). Por defecto: un NUEVO espacio de trabajo de la máquina con el nombre\n                                                      del documento (puede anularse con --name); --workspace se dirige a un\n                                                      espacio de trabajo VACÍO existente. Los comandos (`command`) de la terminal se escriben en\n                                                      shells de inicio de sesión iniciados en el `cwd` de cada superficie (relativo a\n                                                      --cwd, por defecto: la carpeta de inicio del usuario de trabajo). --open luego abre el espacio de trabajo aquí\n                                                      con la misma geometría.\n\nDocumento (uno de los siguientes):\n  {\"pane\": {\"surfaces\": [{\"type\": \"terminal\", \"name\": \"tests\", \"command\": \"bun test\", \"cwd\": \"work/app\"}]}}\n  {\"direction\": \"horizontal\"|\"vertical\", \"split\": 0.6, \"children\": [<node>, <node>]}\n  {\"name\": …, \"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}      o      {\"name\": …, \"workspace\": {\"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}}\n`horizontal` = uno al lado del otro (primer hijo a la izquierda), `vertical` = apilados (primer hijo arriba); `split` es la\nproporción del primer hijo (0.1–0.9, por defecto 0.5). Tipos de superficie: terminal (name, command, cwd, env),\nbrowser (url, name); las superficies de tipo proyecto son exclusivas de Mac y se omiten en una máquina.\nLos identificadores de espacio de trabajo provienen de `cmux vm tree`. Añada --json para obtener el resultado sin procesar. Exit 2 = el documento no es válido."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisation :\n  cmux vm layout export <machine> [<workspace-id|name>] [--raw]\n                                                      Afficher l'agencement d'un espace de travail de machine sous forme de document\n                                                      d'agencement déclaratif — le même JSON qu'utilisent `cmux new-workspace --layout`,\n                                                      `cmux layout save/open` et cmux.json. Par défaut : l'espace\n                                                      de travail actif de la machine. --raw affiche le propre\n                                                      LayoutDocument (identifiants de volet/onglet exacts) du démon à la place.\n  cmux vm layout apply <machine> (<file>|- | --from-saved <name>) [--workspace <workspace-id>|--name <name>] [--cwd <dir>] [--open]\n                                                      Créer des volets, séparations et onglets sur la machine à partir d'un document\n                                                      d'agencement : un fichier, stdin (-) ou un agencement enregistré sur ce Mac\n                                                      (`cmux layout list`). Par défaut : un NOUVEL espace de travail de machine nommé\n                                                      d'après le document (--name prévaut) ; --workspace cible un\n                                                      espace de travail VIDE existant. Les `command`es de terminal sont saisies dans\n                                                      des shells de connexion démarrés dans le `cwd` de chaque surface (relatif à\n                                                      --cwd, par défaut : le répertoire personnel de l'utilisateur de travail). --open ouvre ensuite l'espace de travail ici\n                                                      avec la même géométrie.\n\nDocument (l'un des suivants) :\n  {\"pane\": {\"surfaces\": [{\"type\": \"terminal\", \"name\": \"tests\", \"command\": \"bun test\", \"cwd\": \"work/app\"}]}}\n  {\"direction\": \"horizontal\"|\"vertical\", \"split\": 0.6, \"children\": [<node>, <node>]}\n  {\"name\": …, \"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}      ou      {\"name\": …, \"workspace\": {\"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}}\n`horizontal` = côte à côte (premier enfant à gauche), `vertical` = empilé (premier enfant en haut) ; `split` représente la\npart du premier enfant (0.1–0.9, par défaut 0.5). Types de surface : terminal (name, command, cwd, env),\nbrowser (url, name) ; les surfaces de projet sont réservées au Mac et ignorées sur une machine.\nLes identifiants d'espace de travail proviennent de `cmux vm tree`. Ajoutez --json pour obtenir le résultat brut. Code de sortie 2 = le document n'est pas valide."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Usage:\n  cmux vm layout export <machine> [<workspace-id|name>] [--raw]\n                                                      Print a machine workspace's layout as a declarative layout\n                                                      document — the same JSON `cmux new-workspace --layout`,\n                                                      `cmux layout save/open`, and cmux.json use. Default: the\n                                                      machine's focused workspace. --raw prints the daemon's own\n                                                      LayoutDocument (exact pane/tab ids) instead.\n  cmux vm layout apply <machine> (<file>|- | --from-saved <name>) [--workspace <workspace-id>|--name <name>] [--cwd <dir>] [--open]\n                                                      Build panes, splits, and tabs on the machine from a layout\n                                                      document: a file, stdin (-), or a layout saved on this Mac\n                                                      (`cmux layout list`). Default: a NEW machine workspace named\n                                                      after the document (--name overrides); --workspace targets an\n                                                      existing EMPTY workspace. Terminal `command`s are typed into\n                                                      login shells started in each surface's `cwd` (relative to\n                                                      --cwd, default: the work user's home). --open then opens the workspace here\n                                                      with the same geometry.\n\nDocument (one of):\n  {\"pane\": {\"surfaces\": [{\"type\": \"terminal\", \"name\": \"tests\", \"command\": \"bun test\", \"cwd\": \"work/app\"}]}}\n  {\"direction\": \"horizontal\"|\"vertical\", \"split\": 0.6, \"children\": [<node>, <node>]}\n  {\"name\": …, \"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}      or      {\"name\": …, \"workspace\": {\"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}}\n`horizontal` = side by side (first child left), `vertical` = stacked (first child top); `split` is the\nfirst child's share (0.1–0.9, default 0.5). Surface types: terminal (name, command, cwd, env),\nbrowser (url, name); project surfaces are Mac-only and skipped on a machine.\nWorkspace ids come from `cmux vm tree`. Add --json for the raw result. Exit 2 = the document is invalid."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用法:\n  cmux vm layout export <machine> [<workspace-id|name>] [--raw]\n                                                      マシンのワークスペースのレイアウトを、宣言的なレイアウト\n                                                      ドキュメント（`cmux new-workspace --layout`、\n                                                      `cmux layout save/open`、および cmux.json が使用するものと同じ JSON）として出力します。デフォルト:\n                                                      マシンのフォーカスされたワークスペース。--raw は代わりにデーモン独自の\n                                                      LayoutDocument (正確なペイン/タブ ID) を出力します。\n  cmux vm layout apply <machine> (<file>|- | --from-saved <name>) [--workspace <workspace-id>|--name <name>] [--cwd <dir>] [--open]\n                                                      レイアウトドキュメントから、マシン上にペイン、スプリット、およびタブを\n                                                      構築します。対象: ファイル、標準入力 (-)、またはこの Mac に保存されたレイアウト\n                                                      (`cmux layout list`)。デフォルト: ドキュメント名にちなんで命名された新しいマシンのワークスペース\n                                                      (--name で上書き可能)。--workspace は既存 of 空のワークスペースを\n                                                      対象とします。ターミナルの `command` は、各サーフェスの\n                                                      `cwd`（--cwd に対する相対パス、デフォルト: ワークユーザーのホーム）で起動された\n                                                      ログインシェルに入力されます。その後、--open は同じジオメトリで\n                                                      ここにあるワークスペースを開きます。\n\nドキュメント (いずれか):\n  {\"pane\": {\"surfaces\": [{\"type\": \"terminal\", \"name\": \"tests\", \"command\": \"bun test\", \"cwd\": \"work/app\"}]}}\n  {\"direction\": \"horizontal\"|\"vertical\", \"split\": 0.6, \"children\": [<node>, <node>]}\n  {\"name\": …, \"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}      または      {\"name\": …, \"workspace\": {\"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}}\n`horizontal` = 横並び (最初の子が左)、`vertical` = 縦並び (最初の子が上)。`split` は\n最初の子の割合 (0.1–0.9、デフォルト 0.5) です。サーフェスの種類: terminal (name, command, cwd, env),\nbrowser (url, name)。project サーフェスは Mac 専用であり、マシン上ではスキップされます。\nワークスペース ID は `cmux vm tree` から取得されます。生の結果を得るには --json を追加します。終了コード 2 = ドキュメントが無効。"
          }
        },
        "km": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "របៀបប្រើ:\n  cmux vm layout export <machine> [<workspace-id|name>] [--raw]\n                                                      បោះពុម្ព layout របស់ machine workspace ជា layout\n                                                      document ប្រកាស — JSON ដូចគ្នាដែល `cmux new-workspace --layout`,\n                                                      `cmux layout save/open`, និង cmux.json ប្រើ។ លំនាំដើម:\n                                                      workspace ដែលផ្ដោតអារម្មណ៍របស់ machine។ --raw បោះពុម្ព\n                                                      LayoutDocument ផ្ទាល់ខ្លួនរបស់ daemon (pane/tab ids ពិតប្រាកដ)។\n  cmux vm layout apply <machine> (<file>|- | --from-saved <name>) [--workspace <workspace-id>|--name <name>] [--cwd <dir>] [--open]\n                                                      បង្កើត panes, splits, និង tabs នៅលើ machine ពី layout\n                                                      document: file, stdin (-), ឬ layout ដែលរក្សាទុកនៅ Mac នេះ\n                                                      (`cmux layout list`)។ លំនាំដើម: machine workspace ថ្មីដែលដាក់ឈ្មោះ\n                                                      តាម document (--name ជំនួស); --workspace កំណត់គោលដៅ\n                                                      workspace ដែលមានស្រាប់ EMPTY។ `command`s របស់ Terminal ត្រូវបានវាយ\n                                                      ទៅក្នុង login shells ដែលចាប់ផ្ដើមនៅក្នុង `cwd` របស់ surface នីមួយៗ\n                                                      (ទាក់ទងទៅ --cwd, លំនាំដើម: home របស់ work user)។ --open បន្ទាប់មក\n                                                      បើក workspace នៅទីនេះដោយ geometry ដូចគ្នា។\n\nDocument (ជ្រើសរើសមួយ):\n  {\"pane\": {\"surfaces\": [{\"type\": \"terminal\", \"name\": \"tests\", \"command\": \"bun test\", \"cwd\": \"work/app\"}]}}\n  {\"direction\": \"horizontal\"|\"vertical\", \"split\": 0.6, \"children\": [<node>, <node>]}\n  {\"name\": …, \"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}      or      {\"name\": …, \"workspace\": {\"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}}\n`horizontal` = ចំហៀងទៅចំហៀង (កូនទីមួយខាងឆ្វេង), `vertical` = ជង់ (កូនទីមួយខាងលើ); `split` គឺ\nចំណែករបស់កូនទីមួយ (0.1–0.9, លំនាំដើម 0.5)។ ប្រភេទ Surface: terminal (name, command, cwd, env),\nbrowser (url, name); project surfaces ប្រើបានតែនៅ Mac ហើយត្រូវបានរំលងនៅលើ machine។\nWorkspace ids មកពី `cmux vm tree`។ បន្ថែម --json សម្រាប់លទ្ធផលដើម។ Exit 2 = document មិនត្រឹមត្រូវ។"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "사용법:\n  cmux vm layout export <machine> [<workspace-id|name>] [--raw]\n                                                      머신 워크스페이스의 레이아웃을 선언적 레이아웃 문서로\n                                                      출력합니다 — `cmux new-workspace --layout`,\n                                                      `cmux layout save/open` 및 cmux.json에서 사용하는 것과 동일한 JSON입니다. 기본값: 머신의\n                                                      포커스된 워크스페이스. --raw는 대신 데몬 자체의\n                                                      LayoutDocument(정확한 창/탭 ID)를 출력합니다.\n  cmux vm layout apply <machine> (<file>|- | --from-saved <name>) [--workspace <workspace-id>|--name <name>] [--cwd <dir>] [--open]\n                                                      레이아웃 문서로부터 머신에 창, 분할(split) 및 탭을 구축합니다:\n                                                      문서: 파일, stdin (-) 또는 이 Mac에 저장된 레이아웃\n                                                      (`cmux layout list`). 기본값: 문서 이름을 딴 새로운 머신 워크스페이스\n                                                      (--name으로 재정의 가능); --workspace는 기존의 비어 있는\n                                                      워크스페이스를 대상으로 합니다. 터미널 `command`들은\n                                                      각 서피스의 `cwd`에서 시작된 로그인 셸에 입력됩니다 (이는\n                                                      --cwd 기준이며, 기본값: 작업 사용자의 홈). 그런 다음 --open은 여기에서\n                                                      동일한 구조(geometry)로 워크스페이스를 엽니다.\n\n문서 (다음 중 하나):\n  {\"pane\": {\"surfaces\": [{\"type\": \"terminal\", \"name\": \"tests\", \"command\": \"bun test\", \"cwd\": \"work/app\"}]}}\n  {\"direction\": \"horizontal\"|\"vertical\", \"split\": 0.6, \"children\": [<node>, <node>]}\n  {\"name\": …, \"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}      또는      {\"name\": …, \"workspace\": {\"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}}\n`horizontal` = 가로 병렬 배치 (첫 번째 자식이 왼쪽), `vertical` = 세로 쌓음 배치 (첫 번째 자식이 위쪽); `split`은\n첫 번째 자식의 비율(0.1–0.9, 기본값 0.5)입니다. 서피스(surface) 유형: terminal (name, command, cwd, env),\nbrowser (url, name); project 서피스는 Mac 전용이며 머신에서는 건너뜁니다.\n워크스페이스 ID는 `cmux vm tree`에서 얻을 수 있습니다. 원시 결과를 보려면 --json을 추가하십시오. Exit 2 = 문서가 유효하지 않음."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Usage:\n  cmux vm layout export <machine> [<workspace-id|name>] [--raw]\n                                                      Print a machine workspace's layout as a declarative layout\n                                                      document — the same JSON `cmux new-workspace --layout`,\n                                                      `cmux layout save/open`, and cmux.json use. Default: the\n                                                      machine's focused workspace. --raw prints the daemon's own\n                                                      LayoutDocument (exact pane/tab ids) instead.\n  cmux vm layout apply <machine> (<file>|- | --from-saved <name>) [--workspace <workspace-id>|--name <name>] [--cwd <dir>] [--open]\n                                                      Build panes, splits, and tabs on the machine from a layout\n                                                      document: a file, stdin (-), or a layout saved on this Mac\n                                                      (`cmux layout list`). Default: a NEW machine workspace named\n                                                      after the document (--name overrides); --workspace targets an\n                                                      existing EMPTY workspace. Terminal `command`s are typed into\n                                                      login shells started in each surface's `cwd` (relative to\n                                                      --cwd, default: the work user's home). --open then opens the workspace here\n                                                      with the same geometry.\n\nDocument (one of):\n  {\"pane\": {\"surfaces\": [{\"type\": \"terminal\", \"name\": \"tests\", \"command\": \"bun test\", \"cwd\": \"work/app\"}]}}\n  {\"direction\": \"horizontal\"|\"vertical\", \"split\": 0.6, \"children\": [<node>, <node>]}\n  {\"name\": …, \"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}      or      {\"name\": …, \"workspace\": {\"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}}\n`horizontal` = side by side (first child left), `vertical` = stacked (first child top); `split` is the\nfirst child's share (0.1–0.9, default 0.5). Surface types: terminal (name, command, cwd, env),\nbrowser (url, name); project surfaces are Mac-only and skipped on a machine.\nWorkspace ids come from `cmux vm tree`. Add --json for the raw result. Exit 2 = the document is invalid."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Użycie:\n  cmux vm layout export <machine> [<workspace-id|name>] [--raw]\n                                                      Wyświetla układ przestrzeni roboczej maszyny jako deklaratywny\n                                                      dokument układu — ten sam JSON, którego używają `cmux new-workspace --layout`,\n                                                      `cmux layout save/open` i cmux.json. Domyślnie: aktywna\n                                                      przestrzeń robocza maszyny. --raw wyświetla własny\n                                                      LayoutDocument demona (dokładne id paneli/kart).\n  cmux vm layout apply <machine> (<file>|- | --from-saved <name>) [--workspace <workspace-id>|--name <name>] [--cwd <dir>] [--open]\n                                                      Tworzy panele, podziały i karty na maszynie na podstawie\n                                                      dokumentu układu: pliku, stdin (-) lub układu zapisanego na tym Macu\n                                                      (`cmux layout list`). Domyślnie: NOWA przestrzeń robocza maszyny\n                                                      nazwana od dokumentu (--name nadpisuje); --workspace wskazuje\n                                                      istniejącą PUSTĄ przestrzeń roboczą. Polecenia terminala `command`\n                                                      są wpisywane do powłok logowania uruchamianych w `cwd` każdej\n                                                      powierzchni (względem --cwd, domyślnie: katalog domowy użytkownika work). --open otwiera następnie przestrzeń roboczą tutaj\n                                                      z tą samą geometrią.\n\nDokument (jeden z):\n  {\"pane\": {\"surfaces\": [{\"type\": \"terminal\", \"name\": \"tests\", \"command\": \"bun test\", \"cwd\": \"work/app\"}]}}\n  {\"direction\": \"horizontal\"|\"vertical\", \"split\": 0.6, \"children\": [<node>, <node>]}\n  {\"name\": …, \"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}      lub      {\"name\": …, \"workspace\": {\"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}}\n`horizontal` = obok siebie (pierwsze dziecko po lewej), `vertical` = ułożone pionowo (pierwsze dziecko na górze); `split` to\nudział pierwszego dziecka (0.1–0.9, domyślnie 0.5). Typy powierzchni: terminal (name, command, cwd, env),\nbrowser (url, name); powierzchnie projektu są dostępne tylko na Macu i pomijane na maszynie.\nId przestrzeni roboczych pochodzą z `cmux vm tree`. Dodaj --json, aby uzyskać surowy wynik. Kod wyjścia 2 = dokument jest nieprawidłowy."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Usage:\n  cmux vm layout export <machine> [<workspace-id|name>] [--raw]\n                                                      Print a machine workspace's layout as a declarative layout\n                                                      document — the same JSON `cmux new-workspace --layout`,\n                                                      `cmux layout save/open`, and cmux.json use. Default: the\n                                                      machine's focused workspace. --raw prints the daemon's own\n                                                      LayoutDocument (exact pane/tab ids) instead.\n  cmux vm layout apply <machine> (<file>|- | --from-saved <name>) [--workspace <workspace-id>|--name <name>] [--cwd <dir>] [--open]\n                                                      Build panes, splits, and tabs on the machine from a layout\n                                                      document: a file, stdin (-), or a layout saved on this Mac\n                                                      (`cmux layout list`). Default: a NEW machine workspace named\n                                                      after the document (--name overrides); --workspace targets an\n                                                      existing EMPTY workspace. Terminal `command`s are typed into\n                                                      login shells started in each surface's `cwd` (relative to\n                                                      --cwd, default: the work user's home). --open then opens the workspace here\n                                                      with the same geometry.\n\nDocument (one of):\n  {\"pane\": {\"surfaces\": [{\"type\": \"terminal\", \"name\": \"tests\", \"command\": \"bun test\", \"cwd\": \"work/app\"}]}}\n  {\"direction\": \"horizontal\"|\"vertical\", \"split\": 0.6, \"children\": [<node>, <node>]}\n  {\"name\": …, \"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}      or      {\"name\": …, \"workspace\": {\"cwd\": …, \"layout\": <node>}}\n`horizontal` = side by side (first child left), `vertical` = stacked (first child top); `split` is the\nfirst child's share (0.1–0.9, default 0.5). Surface types: terminal (name, command, cwd, env),\nbrowser (url, name); project surfaces are Mac-only and skipped on a machine.\nWorkspace ids come from `cmux vm tree`. Add --json for the raw result. Exit 2 = the document is invalid."
          }
        },
