            "value": "Die Vorlage Worktree Agents öffnen, ihre actions/ui/commands-Einträge in cmux.json übernehmen, Worktree-cwd und Agentenbefehle anpassen und cmux reload-config ausführen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrez la recette Worktree Agents, ajoutez ses entrées actions/ui/commands à cmux.json, adaptez le cwd du worktree et les commandes d’agent, puis exécutez cmux reload-config."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abre la receta Worktree Agents, incorpora sus entradas actions/ui/commands en cmux.json, adapta el cwd del worktree y los comandos de agentes, y ejecuta cmux reload-config."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "افتح وصفة Worktree Agents، وأضف عناصر actions/ui/commands إلى cmux.json، وعدّل cwd لشجرة العمل وأوامر الوكلاء، ثم شغّل cmux reload-config."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 Worktree Agents 配方，将 actions/ui/commands 条目合并到 cmux.json，调整 worktree 的 cwd 和代理命令，然后运行 cmux reload-config。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟 Worktree Agents 配方，將 actions/ui/commands 項目合併到 cmux.json，調整 worktree 的 cwd 和代理命令，然後執行 cmux reload-config。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worktree Agents 설정 예제를 열고 actions/ui/commands 항목을 cmux.json에 병합한 뒤 worktree의 cwd와 에이전트 명령을 수정하고 cmux reload-config를 실행하세요."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worktree Agents レシピを開き、actions/ui/commands を cmux.json に追加し、worktree の cwd とエージェントのコマンドを調整して cmux reload-config を実行します。"
          }
        },
        "bs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Otvorite Worktree Agents recept, spojite actions/ui/commands stavke u cmux.json, prilagodite worktree cwd i naredbe agenata, zatim pokrenite cmux reload-config."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Åbn Worktree Agents-opskriften, flet dens actions/ui/commands-poster ind i cmux.json, tilpas worktree-cwd og agentkommandoer, og kør derefter cmux reload-config."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Apri la ricetta Worktree Agents, unisci le voci actions/ui/commands in cmux.json, adatta il cwd del worktree e i comandi degli agenti, quindi esegui cmux reload-config."
          }
        },
        "km": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "បើក recipe Worktree Agents, បញ្ចូលធាតុ actions/ui/commands របស់វាទៅ cmux.json, កែសម្រួល cwd worktree និង commands agent, រួចដំណើរការ cmux reload-config."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Åpne Worktree Agents-oppskriften, flett inn actions/ui/commands-oppføringene i cmux.json, tilpass worktree-cwd og agentkommandoer, og kjør deretter cmux reload-config."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Otwórz przepis Worktree Agents, scal jego wpisy actions/ui/commands do cmux.json, dostosuj worktree cwd i polecenia agentów, a następnie uruchom cmux reload-config."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Abra a receita Worktree Agents, mescle suas entradas actions/ui/commands no cmux.json, adapte o cwd do worktree e os comandos de agente e execute cmux reload-config."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Откройте рецепт Worktree Agents, объедините его записи actions/ui/commands в cmux.json, адаптируйте worktree cwd и команды агентов, затем выполните cmux reload-config."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "เปิด recipe Worktree Agents, รวม entries actions/ui/commands เข้ากับ cmux.json, ปรับ worktree cwd และคำสั่ง agent แล้วรัน cmux reload-config"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Worktree Agents tarifini açın, actions/ui/commands girdilerini cmux.json'a ekleyin, worktree cwd ve ajan komutlarını uyarlayın, ardından cmux reload-config komutunu çalıştırın."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Відкрийте рецепт Worktree Agents, об'єднайте його записи actions/ui/commands у cmux.json, адаптуйте cwd worktree і команди агентів, а потім виконайте cmux reload-config."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Mở recipe Worktree Agents, gộp các mục actions/ui/commands vào cmux.json, điều chỉnh worktree cwd và các lệnh agent, sau đó chạy cmux reload-config."
          }
        }
      }
    },
