    "cli.codex-teams.usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\nLaunch Codex with cmux-managed subagent panes.\n\nThis command:\n  - starts a private Codex app-server on localhost\n  - launches the root Codex TUI against that app-server\n  - watches live Codex thread-spawn subagents\n  - opens subagents up to depth 2 as native cmux splits\n  - forwards all remaining arguments to codex\n\nExamples:\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "bs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Upotreba: cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\nPokreni Codex s cmux-upravljanim pločama podagenata.\n\nOva naredba:\n  - pokreće privatni Codex app-server na localhost\n  - pokreće root Codex TUI prema tom app-serveru\n  - prati pokretanje podagenata Codex thread-spawn uživo\n  - otvara podagente do dubine 2 kao native cmux podjele\n  - prosljeđuje sve preostale argumente codex-u\n\nPrimjeri:\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Brug: cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\nStart Codex med cmux-styrede underagentruder.\n\nDenne kommando:\n  - starter en privat Codex app-server på localhost\n  - starter rod-Codex TUI mod den app-server\n  - overvåger live Codex thread-spawn-underagenter\n  - åbner underagenter op til dybde 2 som native cmux-delinger\n  - videresender alle resterende argumenter til codex\n\nEksempler:\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Utilizzo: cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\nAvvia Codex con pannelli subagente gestiti da cmux.\n\nQuesto comando:\n  - avvia un app-server Codex privato su localhost\n  - avvia la TUI Codex principale contro quell'app-server\n  - monitora i subagenti thread-spawn di Codex in tempo reale\n  - apre i subagenti fino alla profondità 2 come split nativi cmux\n  - inoltra tutti gli argomenti rimanenti a codex\n\nEsempi:\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "km": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Usage: cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\nបើក Codex ជាមួយ subagent pane ដែលគ្រប់គ្រងដោយ cmux។\n\nCommand នេះ:\n  - ចាប់ផ្តើម Codex app-server ឯកជននៅ localhost\n  - បើក Codex TUI root ប្រឆាំងនឹង app-server នោះ\n  - តាមដាន subagent ដែល Codex thread-spawn live\n  - បើក subagent រហូតដល់ depth 2 ជា cmux splits ដើម\n  - បញ្ជូន argument ដែលនៅសេសសល់ទាំងអស់ទៅ codex\n\nExamples:\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Bruk: cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\nStart Codex med cmux-administrerte subagent-ruter.\n\nDenne kommandoen:\n  - starter en privat Codex app-server på localhost\n  - starter rot-Codex TUI mot den app-serveren\n  - overvåker live Codex thread-spawn-subagenter\n  - åpner subagenter opp til dybde 2 som native cmux-splits\n  - videresender alle gjenværende argumenter til codex\n\nEksempler:\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Użycie: cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\nUruchamia Codex z panelami subagentów zarządzanymi przez cmux.\n\nTo polecenie:\n  - uruchamia prywatny serwer aplikacji Codex na localhost\n  - uruchamia główne TUI Codex względem tego serwera\n  - obserwuje na żywo subagenty tworzone przez Codex\n  - otwiera subagenty do głębokości 2 jako natywne podziały cmux\n  - przekazuje wszystkie pozostałe argumenty do codex\n\nPrzykłady:\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Uso: cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\nIniciar o Codex com painéis de subagente gerenciados pelo cmux.\n\nEste comando:\n  - inicia um app-server privado do Codex no localhost\n  - inicia o TUI raiz do Codex contra esse app-server\n  - monitora subagentes de thread-spawn do Codex em tempo real\n  - abre subagentes até a profundidade 2 como splits nativos do cmux\n  - encaminha todos os argumentos restantes para o codex\n\nExemplos:\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Использование: cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\nЗапустить Codex с управляемыми cmux панелями субагентов.\n\nЭта команда:\n  - запускает приватный app-server Codex на localhost\n  - запускает корневой Codex TUI против этого app-server\n  - отслеживает субагенты порождения потоков Codex в реальном времени\n  - открывает субагенты до глубины 2 как нативные разделения cmux\n  - передаёт все оставшиеся аргументы в codex\n\nПримеры:\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "การใช้งาน: cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\nเปิด Codex พร้อม subagent pane ที่จัดการโดย cmux\n\nคำสั่งนี้:\n  - เริ่ม Codex app-server แบบส่วนตัวบน localhost\n  - เปิด Codex TUI หลักต่อกับ app-server นั้น\n  - ติดตาม subagent ที่ Codex สร้างขึ้นแบบเรียลไทม์\n  - เปิด subagent ถึงระดับลึก 2 เป็น cmux split แบบ native\n  - ส่งต่ออาร์กิวเมนต์ที่เหลือทั้งหมดไปยัง codex\n\nตัวอย่าง:\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Kullanım: cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\ncmux tarafından yönetilen alt ajan bölmeleriyle Codex'i başlatır.\n\nBu komut:\n  - localhost üzerinde özel bir Codex uygulama sunucusu başlatır\n  - kök Codex TUI'sini o uygulama sunucusuna karşı başlatır\n  - canlı Codex iş parçacığı oluşturan alt ajanları izler\n  - derinlik 2'ye kadar alt ajanları yerel cmux bölmeleri olarak açar\n  - kalan tüm bağımsız değişkenleri codex'e iletir\n\nÖrnekler:\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Використання: cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\nЗапустити Codex із підпанелями субагентів під керуванням cmux.\n\nЦя команда:\n  - запускає приватний app-server Codex на localhost\n  - запускає кореневий Codex TUI проти цього app-server\n  - відстежує субагенти, породжені потоками Codex у реальному часі\n  - відкриває субагенти до глибини 2 як нативні розбивки cmux\n  - передає всі інші аргументи до codex\n\nПриклади:\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cách dùng: cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\nKhởi động Codex với các pane subagent do cmux quản lý.\n\nLệnh này:\n  - khởi động private Codex app-server trên localhost\n  - khởi động Codex TUI gốc kết nối với app-server đó\n  - theo dõi các subagent thread-spawn của Codex theo thời gian thực\n  - mở subagent đến độ sâu 2 dưới dạng split native của cmux\n  - chuyển tiếp tất cả đối số còn lại cho codex\n\nVí dụ:\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Verwendung: cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\nCodex mit von cmux verwalteten Subagenten-Fenstern starten.\n\nDieser Befehl:\n  - startet einen privaten Codex-App-Server auf localhost\n  - startet das Codex-Root-TUI gegen diesen App-Server\n  - überwacht live gestartete Codex-Thread-Subagenten\n  - öffnet Subagenten bis Tiefe 2 als native cmux-Splits\n  - leitet alle verbleibenden Argumente an codex weiter\n\nBeispiele:\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Usage: cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\nتشغيل Codex مع أجزاء subagent مُدارة بواسطة cmux.\n\nهذا الأمر:\n  - يشغّل خادم Codex app-server خاصاً على localhost\n  - يشغّل واجهة Codex TUI الجذرية مقابل ذلك app-server\n  - يراقب subagents الخيوط المولودة من Codex مباشرةً\n  - يفتح subagents حتى العمق 2 كتقسيمات cmux أصيلة\n  - يمرّر جميع الوسيطات المتبقية إلى codex\n\nأمثلة:\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Utilisation : cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\nLance Codex avec des volets de sous-agents gérés par cmux.\n\nCette commande :\n  - démarre un app-server Codex privé sur localhost\n  - lance le TUI Codex racine contre cet app-server\n  - surveille en direct les sous-agents issus des threads Codex\n  - ouvre les sous-agents jusqu'à la profondeur 2 en découpages natifs cmux\n  - transmet tous les arguments restants à codex\n\nExemples :\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "用法：cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\n使用 cmux 管理的子代理窗格啟動 Codex。\n\n此指令將：\n  - 在 localhost 上啟動私有 Codex app-server\n  - 針對該 app-server 啟動根 Codex TUI\n  - 即時監看 Codex 執行緒產生的子代理\n  - 將深度最多 2 的子代理以原生 cmux 分割窗格開啟\n  - 將所有剩餘引數轉送給 codex\n\n範例：\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Uso: cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\nInicia Codex con paneles de subagente gestionados por cmux.\n\nEste comando:\n  - inicia un app-server privado de Codex en localhost\n  - lanza la TUI raíz de Codex contra ese app-server\n  - monitoriza en vivo los subagentes de hilos de Codex\n  - abre subagentes hasta profundidad 2 como divisiones nativas de cmux\n  - reenvía el resto de argumentos a codex\n\nEjemplos:\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "사용법: cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\ncmux 관리 서브에이전트 패널로 Codex를 실행합니다.\n\n이 명령은:\n  - localhost에서 비공개 Codex app-server를 시작합니다\n  - 해당 app-server에 대해 루트 Codex TUI를 실행합니다\n  - 실시간 Codex 스레드 스폰 서브에이전트를 감시합니다\n  - 깊이 2까지의 서브에이전트를 네이티브 cmux 분할로 엽니다\n  - 나머지 모든 인수를 codex에 전달합니다\n\n예시:\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Usage: cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\ncmux 管理のサブエージェントペインで Codex を起動します。\n\nこのコマンドは:\n  - localhost にプライベートな Codex app-server を起動\n  - その app-server に対してルート Codex TUI を起動\n  - Codex のスレッドスポーンサブエージェントをリアルタイムで監視\n  - 深さ 2 までのサブエージェントをネイティブの cmux スプリットとして開く\n  - 残りの引数をすべて codex に転送\n\nExamples:\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "用法：cmux codex-teams [codex-args...]\n\n使用 cmux 托管的子 agent 面板启动 Codex。\n\n此命令：\n  - 在 localhost 上启动私有 Codex app-server\n  - 针对该 app-server 启动根 Codex TUI\n  - 实时监听 Codex 线程派生的子 agent\n  - 将深度不超过 2 的子 agent 作为原生 cmux 分屏打开\n  - 将所有剩余参数转发给 codex\n\n示例：\n  cmux codex-teams\n  cmux codex-teams --model gpt-5.4\n  cmux codex-teams resume --last"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.omx.usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux omx [omx-args...]\n\nLaunch Oh My Codex (OMX) with native cmux pane integration.\n\nOMX is a multi-agent orchestration layer for OpenAI Codex CLI. This\ncommand sets up a tmux shim so OMX team mode, HUD, and agent panes\nbecome native cmux splits.\n\nThis command:\n  - sets a tmux-like environment so OMX uses cmux splits\n  - prepends a private tmux shim to PATH\n  - forwards all remaining arguments to omx\n\nInstall: npm install -g oh-my-codex\n\nExamples:\n  cmux omx\n  cmux omx --madmax --high\n  cmux omx team"
          }
        },
        "bs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Upotreba: cmux omx [omx-args...]\n\nPokreni Oh My Codex (OMX) s native integracijom cmux okana.\n\nOMX je višeagentni orkestracijský sloj za OpenAI Codex CLI. Ova\nnaredba postavlja tmux shim kako bi OMX timski mod, HUD i okna agenata\npostali native cmux podjele.\n\nOva naredba:\n  - postavlja okruženje nalik tmux-u kako bi OMX koristio cmux podjele\n  - dodaje privatni tmux shim na početak PATH\n  - prosljeđuje sve preostale argumente omx-u\n\nInstalacija: npm install -g oh-my-codex\n\nPrimjeri:\n  cmux omx\n  cmux omx --madmax --high\n  cmux omx team"
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Brug: cmux omx [omx-args...]\n\nStart Oh My Codex (OMX) med native cmux-rudeintegration.\n\nOMX er et multi-agent-orkestreringslag til OpenAI Codex CLI. Denne\nkommando opsætter en tmux-shim, så OMX team mode, HUD og agentruder\nbliver native cmux-delinger.\n\nDenne kommando:\n  - sætter et tmux-lignende miljø så OMX bruger cmux-delinger\n  - tilføjer en privat tmux-shim forrest i PATH\n  - videresender alle resterende argumenter til omx\n\nInstaller: npm install -g oh-my-codex\n\nEksempler:\n  cmux omx\n  cmux omx --madmax --high\n  cmux omx team"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Utilizzo: cmux omx [omx-args...]\n\nAvvia Oh My Codex (OMX) con integrazione nativa dei pannelli cmux.\n\nOMX è uno strato di orchestrazione multi-agente per OpenAI Codex CLI. Questo\ncomando configura uno shim tmux affinché la modalità team, HUD e i pannelli\nagente di OMX diventino split nativi cmux.\n\nQuesto comando:\n  - imposta un ambiente simile a tmux affinché OMX usi gli split cmux\n  - antepone uno shim tmux privato al PATH\n  - inoltra tutti gli argomenti rimanenti a omx\n\nInstallazione: npm install -g oh-my-codex\n\nEsempi:\n  cmux omx\n  cmux omx --madmax --high\n  cmux omx team"
          }
        },
        "km": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Usage: cmux omx [omx-args...]\n\nបើក Oh My Codex (OMX) ជាមួយការភ្ជាប់ cmux pane ដើម។\n\nOMX គឺជា multi-agent orchestration layer សម្រាប់ OpenAI Codex CLI។ Command\nនេះដំឡើង tmux shim ដើម្បីឱ្យ OMX team mode, HUD, និង agent pane\nក្លាយជា cmux splits ដើម។\n\nCommand នេះ:\n  - កំណត់ environment ដូច tmux ដើម្បីឱ្យ OMX ប្រើ cmux splits\n  - បន្ថែម tmux shim ឯកជននៅដើម PATH\n  - បញ្ជូន argument ដែលនៅសេសសល់ទាំងអស់ទៅ omx\n\nInstall: npm install -g oh-my-codex\n\nExamples:\n  cmux omx\n  cmux omx --madmax --high\n  cmux omx team"
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Bruk: cmux omx [omx-args...]\n\nStart Oh My Codex (OMX) med native cmux-rute-integrasjon.\n\nOMX er et multi-agent orkestreringslag for OpenAI Codex CLI. Denne\nkommandoen setter opp et tmux-shim slik at OMX team-modus, HUD og agent-ruter\nblir native cmux-splits.\n\nDenne kommandoen:\n  - setter et tmux-lignende miljø slik at OMX bruker cmux-splits\n  - legger til et privat tmux-shim fremst i PATH\n  - videresender alle gjenværende argumenter til omx\n\nInstaller: npm install -g oh-my-codex\n\nEksempler:\n  cmux omx\n  cmux omx --madmax --high\n  cmux omx team"
          }
