    "cli.omc.usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux omc [omc-args...]\n\nLaunch Oh My Claude Code (OMC) with native cmux pane integration.\n\nOMC is a multi-agent orchestration system for Claude Code with\nspecialized agents, smart model routing, and team pipelines. This\ncommand sets up a tmux shim so OMC team mode and agent panes become\nnative cmux splits.\n\nThis command:\n  - sets a tmux-like environment so OMC uses cmux splits\n  - prepends a private tmux shim to PATH\n  - injects NODE_OPTIONS restore module for Claude compatibility\n  - forwards all remaining arguments to omc\n\nInstall: npm install -g oh-my-claude-sisyphus\n\nExamples:\n  cmux omc\n  cmux omc team 3:claude \"implement feature\"\n  cmux omc --watch"
          }
        },
        "bs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Upotreba: cmux omc [omc-args...]\n\nPokreni Oh My Claude Code (OMC) s native integracijom cmux okana.\n\nOMC je višeagentni orkestracijský sistem za Claude Code sa\nspecijaliziranim agentima, pametnim usmjeravanjem modela i timskim cjevovodima. Ova\nnaredba postavlja tmux shim kako bi OMC timski mod i okna agenata postali\nnative cmux podjele.\n\nOva naredba:\n  - postavlja okruženje nalik tmux-u kako bi OMC koristio cmux podjele\n  - dodaje privatni tmux shim na početak PATH\n  - ubacuje NODE_OPTIONS restore modul za Claude kompatibilnost\n  - prosljeđuje sve preostale argumente omc-u\n\nInstalacija: npm install -g oh-my-claude-sisyphus\n\nPrimjeri:\n  cmux omc\n  cmux omc team 3:claude \"implement feature\"\n  cmux omc --watch"
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
